			"notes": "# Create: Buzzy Beez 1.5.1\n\n## Share schematics\n- **New share button in the Construction Planner:** posts the schematic to chat with a spinning 3D preview.\n- Other players click **[Save]** to download it, or click the preview to look closer.\n- Schematics over 4 MB are shared without the preview. The limit is 32 MB.\n\n## Construction Planner\n- **Delete folders:** removes the folder and everything inside it, after a confirmation.\n- **Rename folders.**\n\n## Bees\n- **Big schematics are much faster:** planning a 1.3 million block schematic is now almost instant, and bees no longer hover in place waiting on the server. The progress toast is gone.\n- **New config `beeInstantBreaking`:** turn it off and bees take as long as the best diamond tool would, so obsidian takes much longer than dirt. Honey Efficiency upgrades now speed this up.\n- **Block-cracking animation** while bees break blocks.\n\n## Config changes\n- `maxBlockOperationsPerTick` is replaced by `blockOperationBudgetMs` (default 5 ms per tick).\n- `taskGenerationBlocksPerTick` is replaced by `taskGenerationBudgetMs` (default 15 ms per tick).\n- Servers that changed the old options go back to the defaults.\n\n## Fixes\n- Fixed the copy tool still showing Construct as selected after pasting."
		},
