			"notes": "# Create: Buzzy Beez 1.5.0\n\n## Construction Planner rework\n- **New full-screen planner GUI** with proper textures.\n- **New 3D preview** that uses the same renderer as the in-world ghost blocks.\n- **Drag and drop:** drag schematics and folders to move them.\n- **Multi-select:** Ctrl/Cmd+click picks single entries, Shift+click picks a range, Ctrl+A selects everything. Move or delete several schematics at once.\n\n## Remove placed schematics\n- **New \"Remove Build\" mode on the Deconstruction Planner:** look at a schematic your bees built and right-click to have them take it down again.\n- While holding the planner, the builds you can remove are highlighted in light red.\n\n## Schematic Zapper\n- **Rotating 3D preview** of the current shape, in the block you picked.\n- **Walls Only mode:** the hollow button now cycles Solid → Hollow → Walls Only. Walls Only removes ceiling and floor, so you get rooms and towers.\n- \n## Bees\n- **Smarter port choice:** bees now pick the port closest to their route instead of any port in the network.\n- **Network colors:** each bee network has its own color\n- **Easier crafting:** Mechanical Bees and Bumble Bees no longer need Precision Mechanisms.\n\n## Fixes\n- Fixed a startup crash with **Create: Pattern Schematics**.\n- Fixed bees failing to place belts when redoing (or undoing a deconstruction of) a belt.\n\n## Other Changes\n- Shortened and cleaned up many item, GUI and chat texts."
		},
